{"type":"message","id":"51298e0f","parentId":"9059501a","timestamp":"2026-06-04T10:24:15.514Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_AY89a19xOvM65I3Whx1x4-3HLyKw9o8d395ret2iNgQEQ58xEXsn6dyqV0OU-v0hOAjenE_ESRlVsA8v9iajizNN-1T1Rmw_D46-bvWDJIV_NAlq6fdXK5FpTrFblCI0WZmI53KLg-LW_Zzsk1NOG_j9v8xjZvS7SmHqz4HrgVHieSBUElx7XiOWmwID38jMNhibfcanajy32PBVFlsej4s8Q3LK2YmUA2A","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: gog drive (drv) search <query> ... [flags]\nBuild: v0.13.0 (5cd913e)\n\nFull-text search across Drive\n\nArguments:\n  <query> ...    Search query\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help                   Show context-sensitive help.\n      --color=\"auto\"           Color output: auto|always|never\n  -a, --account=STRING         Account email for API commands\n                               (gmail/calendar/chat/classroom/drive/docs/slides/contacts/tasks/people/sheets/forms/appscript/ads)\n      --client=\"\"              OAuth client name (selects stored credentials +\n                               token bucket)\n      --access-token=STRING    Use provided access token directly (bypasses\n                               stored refresh tokens; token expires in ~1h)\n                               ($GOG_ACCESS_TOKEN)\n      --enable-commands=\"\"     Comma-separated list of enabled commands;\n                               dot paths allowed (restricts CLI)\n      --disable-commands=\"\"    Comma-separated list of disabled commands;\n                               dot paths allowed\n      --gmail-no-send          Block Gmail send operations (agent safety)\n  -j, --json                   Output JSON to stdout (best for scripting)\n  -p, --plain                  Output stable, parseable text to stdout (TSV;\n                               no colors)\n      --results-only           In JSON mode, emit only the primary result (drops\n                               envelope fields like nextPageToken)\n      --select=STRING          In JSON mode, select comma-separated fields\n                               (best-effort; supports dot paths). Desire path:\n                               use --fields for most commands.\n  -n, --dry-run                Do not make changes; print intended actions and\n                               exit successfully\n  -y, --force                  Skip confirmations for destructive commands\n      --no-input               Never prompt; fail instead (useful for CI)\n  -v, --verbose                Enable verbose logging\n      --version                Print version and exit\n\n      --raw-query              Treat query as Drive query language (pass\n                               through; may error if invalid)\n      --max=20                 Max results\n      --page=STRING            Page token\n      --[no-]all-drives        Include shared drives (default: true; use\n                               --no-all-drives for My Drive only)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":227,"aggregated":"Usage: gog drive (drv) search <query> ... [flags]\nBuild: v0.13.0 (5cd913e)\n\nFull-text search across Drive\n\nArguments:\n  <query> ...    Search query\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help                   Show context-sensitive help.\n      --color=\"auto\"           Color output: auto|always|never\n  -a, --account=STRING         Account email for API commands\n                               (gmail/calendar/chat/classroom/drive/docs/slides/contacts/tasks/people/sheets/forms/appscript/ads)\n      --client=\"\"              OAuth client name (selects stored credentials +\n                               token bucket)\n      --access-token=STRING    Use provided access token directly (bypasses\n                               stored refresh tokens; token expires in ~1h)\n                               ($GOG_ACCESS_TOKEN)\n      --enable-commands=\"\"     Comma-separated list of enabled commands;\n                               dot paths allowed (restricts CLI)\n      --disable-commands=\"\"    Comma-separated list of disabled commands;\n                               dot paths allowed\n      --gmail-no-send          Block Gmail send operations (agent safety)\n  -j, --json                   Output JSON to stdout (best for scripting)\n  -p, --plain                  Output stable, parseable text to stdout (TSV;\n                               no colors)\n      --results-only           In JSON mode, emit only the primary result (drops\n                               envelope fields like nextPageToken)\n      --select=STRING          In JSON mode, select comma-separated fields\n                               (best-effort; supports dot paths). Desire path:\n                               use --fields for most commands.\n  -n, --dry-run                Do not make changes; print intended actions and\n                               exit successfully\n  -y, --force                  Skip confirmations for destructive commands\n      --no-input               Never prompt; fail instead (useful for CI)\n  -v, --verbose                Enable verbose logging\n      --version                Print version and exit\n\n      --raw-query              Treat query as Drive query language (pass\n                               through; may error if invalid)\n      --max=20                 Max results\n      --page=STRING            Page token\n      --[no-]all-drives        Include shared drives (default: true; use\n                               --no-all-drives for My Drive only)","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780568655514}}
